{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23537","headline":"荅刘和州禹锡 · 白居易","name":"荅刘和州禹锡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"换印虽频命未通，历阳湖上又秋风。\n不教才展休明代，爲罚诗争造化功。\n我亦思归田舍下，君应厌卧郡斋中。\n好相收拾爲闲伴，年齿官班约略同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}